flowchart TD
    %% Standard DFD Shapes
    classDef process fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#2e7d32,stroke-width:2px,rx:10,ry:10;
    classDef entity fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1565c0,stroke-width:2px,shape:rect;
    classDef store fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#ef6c00,stroke-width:2px,shape:cylinder;

    %% Nodes
    Student[Student]:::entity
    Process1[1. Login & Auth]:::process
    Process2[2. Check Schedule]:::process
    Process3[3. Submit Booking]:::process
    Process4[4. Notify Counselor]:::process
    
    DB_Users[(Users DB)]:::store
    DB_Appt[(Appointments DB)]:::store
    DB_Notif[(Notifications DB)]:::store

    %% Flow
    Student -->|Credentials| Process1
    Process1 <-->|Validate| DB_Users
    
    Process1 -->|Token| Process2
    Process2 <-->|Get Slots| DB_Appt
    
    Student -->|Select Date/Time + Wellness Info| Process3
    Process3 -->|Save Appointment| DB_Appt
    
    Process3 -->|Trigger| Process4
    Process4 -->|Save Alert| DB_Notif
    Process4 -->|Email Sent| Counselor[Counselor]:::entity